---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Not This Time (我忍住啦)"
  description="Not This Time is a local-first, privacy-by-design iOS app. We do not create accounts, collect personal info, or track user data."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-night-900/80 p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-sm">
      
      <!-- English Version -->
      <section class="border-b border-slate-800 pb-12">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
          Not This Time · Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">Effective Date: May 13, 2026</p>

        <div class="prose prose-invert prose-slate max-w-none mt-8 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
          <p>
            Welcome to <strong>Not This Time</strong> (also known as <em>我忍住啦</em>).
          </p>
          <p>
            Not This Time is a local-first iOS app designed to help users manage food cravings and impulse control through mindfulness and timed intervention techniques.
          </p>
          <p>
            We value your privacy and minimize data collection whenever possible. This app operates locally on your device and does not upload, share, or sell your personal information.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">1. Data Collection</h2>
          <p>This app does <strong>not</strong>:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
            <li>Create user accounts</li>
            <li>Require user login or email</li>
            <li>Collect personally identifiable information (PII)</li>
            <li>Upload user data to developer servers</li>
            <li>Track users for advertising purposes</li>
            <li>Sell user data</li>
            <li>Use third-party advertising SDKs</li>
            <li>Use third-party analytics SDKs</li>
          </ul>
          <p>All user data remains stored locally on your device.</p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">2. Local Storage</h2>
          <p>To support core app functionality, the app may locally store:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
            <li>Countdown records and logs</li>
            <li>Intervention history</li>
            <li>User preferences & timer settings</li>
            <li>Audio playback configurations</li>
            <li>Statistics and personal success records</li>
          </ul>
          <p>This information remains exclusively on your device and is not accessible to the developer.</p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">3. Notification Permission</h2>
          <p>The app may request notification permission in order to provide:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
            <li>Countdown completion alerts</li>
            <li>Intervention reminders</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Notifications are generated locally on your device. No personal information is collected through notification features.</p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">4. Background Audio</h2>
          <p>
            To support meditation guidance, white noise playback, and lock screen audio controls, the app may continue audio playback while running in the background. No personal data is collected or transmitted during audio playback.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">5. Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p>This app currently does not integrate third-party advertising or analytics services.</p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">6. Contact</h2>
          <p>
            If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact:
            <a href="mailto:zhuziwu8@gmail.com" class="text-blue-400 underline font-semibold ml-1">zhuziwu8@gmail.com</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Chinese Version -->
      <section class="pt-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
          我忍住啦 · 隐私政策 (中文版)
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">生效日期：2026 年 5 月 13 日</p>

        <div class="prose prose-invert prose-slate max-w-none mt-8 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
          <p>
            欢迎使用「我忍住啦」。本应用是一款帮助用户进行饮食冲动管理与自我干预的本地离线应用。我们极其重视用户隐私，并尽可能减少任何数据收集行为。
          </p>
          <p>
            本应用主要在您的设备本地运行，默认不会上传、共享或出售您的任何个人信息。
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">1. 数据收集说明</h3>
          <p>「我忍住啦」：</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
            <li>不创建用户账户</li>
            <li>不要求用户登录</li>
            <li>不收集个人身份信息</li>
            <li>不上传用户数据到开发者服务器</li>
            <li>不进行广告追踪</li>
            <li>不出售用户数据</li>
            <li>不使用第三方广告 SDK</li>
            <li>不使用第三方统计分析 SDK</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">2. 本地数据存储</h3>
          <p>
            倒计时记录、干预历史、用户偏好设置、音频播放配置等仅保存在您的手机本地存储中。
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">3. 联系我们</h3>
          <p>
            如果您对本隐私政策有任何疑问，请通过邮箱联系我们：
            <a href="mailto:zhuziwu8@gmail.com" class="text-blue-400 underline font-semibold ml-1">zhuziwu8@gmail.com</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
